name=Traka - Player Shops
id=Traka
description=Turn a counter into a player-run shop, or into an admin buy-back depot that pays players for the goods a server wants collected. Ships nine machine tiles in two families.
description=
description=Stock remembers each item's real condition - a chipped axe lists and sells as a chipped axe, and prices discount automatically from the single price you set. Identical items collapse into one row, so a box of nails costs the save one entry instead of a thousand.
description=
description=Shelf space is a weight quota you expand out of the till. Sales history is kept day by day with a hard ceiling, so a server can run for years without the save growing.
description=
description=Shops are pinned on the world map and named in Thai and English, shown together. Admin approval queue, admin manager with long-distance teleport, and move/scrap protection so only an admin can pick a registered counter up.
description=
description=Saves are schema-versioned: updating the mod never costs you your shops, and a save written by a newer build is refused rather than mangled.
description=
description=Created by AKA (lookchinnoi) for the HaftFull server.
